  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-formula-card\"><header><h3>s3.shape-descriptors</h3><span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--derived\" data-provenance=\"derived\">curated formula</span></header><div><pre class=\"lens-tex\">\\begin{aligned}\\term{compactness}{C}&amp;=\\dfrac{4\\pi\\term{area}{A}}{\\term{perimeter}{P}^2},\\quad\\term{schwartzberg}{S}=\\sqrt{\\term{compactness}{C}},\\quad\\term{convexity}{V}=\\min\\left(\\dfrac{\\term{area}{A}}{\\term{hull-area}{H}},1\\right)\\\\\\term{elongation}{E}&amp;=1-\\sqrt{\\dfrac{\\term{minor}{\\lambda_2}}{\\term{major}{\\lambda_1}}},\\quad\\term{sliver}{F}=\\mathbb{1}\\left[\\term{perimeter}{P}&gt;0\\land(\\term{area}{A}\\le0\\lor\\term{compactness}{C}&lt;\\term{threshold}{\\tau})\\right]\\end{aligned}</pre><p class=\"lens-ascii\">Polsby-Popper C=4*pi*A/P^2; Schwartzberg S=sqrt(C); convexity V=min(A/H,1) for hull area H; elongation E=1-sqrt(lambda2/lambda1) with lambda2=max(mean-radius,0), lambda1=mean+radius from central moments. Sliver is P&gt;0 and (A&lt;=0 or C&lt;threshold). C and S are NaN unless A&gt;0 and P&gt;0, V is NaN without positive hull area, E is NaN without a positive major eigenvalue. Shells contribute positive area and holes negative, regardless of winding.</p></div><div class=\"lens-symbols\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis-shape-descriptors-compiled:shape-descriptors-compactness\" data-value=\"compactness\">Polsby-Popper · output · polsbyPopper</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis-shape-descriptors-compiled:shape-descriptors-measures-feature-output\" data-value=\"area\">Measured polygon area · input · areas</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis-shape-descriptors-compiled:shape-descriptors-compactness\" data-value=\"perimeter\">Measured perimeter including holes · input · perimeters</button><span class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--unknown\" data-value=\"schwartzberg\">Schwartzberg · output · unknown — wgsl schwartzberg not found in this record</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis-shape-descriptors-compiled:shape-descriptors-convexity\" data-value=\"convexity\">Convexity · output · convexities</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis-shape-descriptors-compiled:shape-descriptors-convexity\" data-value=\"hull-area\">Convex hull area · intermediate · hullArea</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis-shape-descriptors-compiled:shape-descriptors-orientation\" data-value=\"elongation\">Elongation · output · elongation</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis-shape-descriptors-compiled:shape-descriptors-orientation\" data-value=\"minor\">Nonnegative minor eigenvalue · intermediate · minor</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis-shape-descriptors-compiled:shape-descriptors-orientation\" data-value=\"major\">Major eigenvalue · intermediate · major</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis-shape-descriptors-compiled:shape-descriptors-compactness\" data-value=\"sliver\">Sliver flag · output · sliver</button><button type=\"button\" class